      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COLD COLD NIGHT (1) boasts a strong record this journey here with two wins and two minors from six tries. Scored by 2.25 lengths last time (23.02) in a Grade 4/5 over 400m at this track. Makes strong appeal on best. STAR (2) boasts a strong record this course with five wins and three minors from 13 tries. Placed last time (25.59) at Grafton in a NG, finishing third and beaten 5.5 lengths. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. SAIL AWAY SAM (3) is a talented type who has been in the money at the last three starts, the latest finishing second (22.98) at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning five races. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. DAPHNE ZACAPA (8) is in winning form and worth including in the main hopes.",
